  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Paris Marathon &apos;23 - Jaydeep &amp; Xavier</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Last year, when my good friend, Xavier, completed a full Ironman, it inspired me to challenge myself in the year that I turn 50 years old. Xavier spiced up the challenge by offering to sponsor me to run the Paris marathon. We run together in Paris on 2nd April 2023 - for the organisation we both love, and the beneficiaries we serve at CR. CR is at the forefront of NGO work - working with urban slum communities to improve healthcare, education and living conditions. Please make it a special 50th.</narrative>
  </description>
